{
"Items.NunsHabit.Desc": "A navy and white nun's habit which looks anything but pure and pious. The short hem looks like it would barely reach its wearer's thighs, and hidden in its pockets are equally religious-seeming items for naughty purposes. The thick and sturdy cross that culminates in a dildo and rosary made of large rubbery beads make it questionable if this really belongs to any religious order."
"Items.NunsHabit.Long": "a scandalous nun's habit"
"Items.NunsHabit.Short": "Nun's Habit"
}
